WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.000
<v Priya (Recruitment)>If a referee still hasn't replied after both reminders, the case should show "Referee not responding".</v>

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
<v Priya (Recruitment)>And the recruiter should get an email about it, so they can call the referee.</v>

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
<v Arjun (Engineering)>Should the recruiter be able to stop the reminders for one referee?</v>

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
<v Priya (Recruitment)>Yes, a "Stop reminders" button on each referee.</v>
